course: dictionary
lesson: 5984
title: MB, Mb and mb in context
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Short forms like MB, Mb and mb can mean different things, so the context tells you which one is meant. «The number of files that fit is space divided by file size: 100 MB holds 20 photos of 5 MB each.» Here MB is a size of computer memory, because we are talking about files and photos.
explain: Capital and small letters matter. MB (capital B) means megabyte, and Mb (small b) means megabit, which is used for internet speed. On a weather map, mb means millibar, a unit of air pressure. Always ask: is this about files, internet speed, or weather?
explain: Check your meaning by putting it back into the sentence. If you read «a 5 MB photo» and think of a photo's file size, megabyte fits. If you read «50 Mbps broadband», you are talking about speed, so megabit per second fits.
fact: MB means megabyte, a unit of computer memory or file size, about one million bytes.
fact: Mb means megabit, and it is used for internet speed (Mbps means megabits per second). 8 megabits make 1 megabyte.
fact: On a weather map, mb means millibar, a unit of air pressure.
fact: MB is also short for Manitoba, a province of Canada, and it can be used for «Bachelor of Medicine» after a doctor's name. Do not confuse these with the letters mb in lamb, climb and thumb, which are a silent-letter group.
exercise: «100 MB holds 20 photos of 5 MB each.» How many photos of 5 MB fit in 100 MB? | 100 | *20 | 500 | 5
exercise: In «100 MB holds 20 photos», what does MB stand for? | Manitoba | *megabyte | millibar | megabit
exercise: On a weather map, you see mb. What does it mean? | megabyte, a unit of file size | *millibar, a unit of air pressure | megabit per second, a unit of internet speed | Manitoba, a province of Canada
test: 8 megabits make 1 megabyte. How many megabits make 1 MB? | *8 | 100 | 1 | 10
test: On a Canadian address, MB is short for which place? | Malta | *Manitoba | Madrid | Maine
exam: A 5 MB photo is sent over a 40 Mbps connection. About how long does it take? | about 5 seconds | *about 1 second | about 8 seconds | about 40 seconds
